# DevSecOps Connection

Boolean logic appears everywhere in automation.

Examples:

### CI/CD

```javascript
if (testsPassed && securityScanPassed) {
    deploy();
}
```

---

### API Authentication

```javascript
if (token && isValidToken) {
    allowAccess();
}
```

---

### Configuration Validation

```javascript
if (!process.env.API_KEY) {
    console.error("Missing API Key");
}
```

---

### File Validation

```javascript
if (fileExists && hasPermission) {
    readFile();
}
```

